# bug-switched-to-cod-submitted-partial-row-not-cod (regression_bug, pre-existing, NOT in the NEARS-4113 diff)
Code: Admin/app/Http/Controllers/Admin/OrderController.php offline_payment() verify=switched_to_cod branch (unchanged by 4113): the unpaid remainder row is turned to cash_on_delivery only inside if($order->payment_method == 'partial_payment'). After the customer offline submit orders.payment_method is 'offline_payment', so the guard never matches (same root class as NEARS-4113's verify-yes guard).
Live repro on QA clone, order 91418 (placed partial+offline, customer submitted, admin denied, admin POST /admin/order/offline-payment?id=91418&verify=switched_to_cod):

## Flow C: submitted partial order (91418) -> admin DENY -> real admin verify=switched_to_cod route (the 4107 AC3 shape: partial + COD remainder, offline_payments row deleted by the route)
